      en: ["Airbus directly employs approximately 28,000 people in the Toulouse metropolitan area.", "The A380 final assembly hall was once one of the largest buildings in the world by volume.", "The first flight of the legendary supersonic Concorde took place in Toulouse in 1969.", "Toulouse is also home to CNES, the French National Centre for Space Studies.", "The delivery center in Toulouse transfers hundreds of aircraft to global airlines each year.", "Airbus is developing the world's first hydrogen-powered commercial aircraft here, aimed for 2035."],
