      en: ["The Cannes Film Festival was first held in 1946.", "Cannes is the second-largest business tourism destination in France after Paris.", "The Palais des Festivals offers over 25,000 square meters of exhibition space.", "MIPCOM attracts over 13,000 participants from 100 countries annually.", "The city hosts approximately 50 major international trade fairs every year.", "The hotel industry in Cannes includes over 100 establishments with a strong luxury focus."],
